Input estop is bool
Input upper_limit is bool
Input joy_up is bool
Input joy_down is bool
Output up_cmd is bool
Output down_cmd is bool

I01: Globally, it is always the case that if "estop" holds then "!up_cmd && !down_cmd" holds as well.
I03: Globally, it is always the case that if "upper_limit" holds then "!up_cmd" holds as well.
I04: Globally, it is always the case that if "upper_limit && joy_down" holds then "down_cmd" holds as well.
I16: Globally, it is always the case that if "joy_up && joy_down" holds then "!up_cmd && !down_cmd" holds as well.
